    \u2022 AnThor</b></size>\r\n<br>\r\n<size=35><color=#CCCCCC>H\u1ECDa s\u0129
    B\u1ED1i c\u1EA3nh & Nh\xE2n v\u1EADt</color></size>\r\n<size=50><b>Gemini</b></size>\r\n<br>\r\n<size=35><color=#CCCCCC>Thi\u1EBFt
